  - Switch / Books Match
  - Zero-Touch Banking depth (confidence approve-all, weekly brief, prod Plaid packaging)
  - Live QuickBooks Online sync
  - Monitor-agent that writes code / opens PRs
  - Entra ID / B2C SSO and MFA product packaging
  - Practice OS / medical RCM join (Fluent MedOps ↔ MA, ClaimId / #702-class)
  - Managed cloud start/pause UI and SLA / ACTO control plane
  - Support SLA tooling

See ADR-0001 and the CE vs paid feature matrix under docs/ when present.
